# Keeps the Docker build context small (the context is the repository root) of
# tests/e2e/agent.Dockerfile and of packaging/hub/Dockerfile (T918). They use global.json, the
# Directory.* files, .editorconfig and src/; the hub image also copies packaging/hub/healthcheck.sh.
